  - PyVista
  - JupyterLite
abstract: >-
  pyvista-js is an open-source Python package that provides a PyVista-like API
  for 3D visualization running entirely in the web browser. By bridging the
  familiar PyVista interface with vtk.js, pyvista-js enables researchers and
  engineers to create interactive 3D visualizations without requiring a local
  VTK installation. The package integrates with JupyterLite, allowing
  zero-install interactive notebooks to be shared as static web pages.
